  v3_status:  "PRODUCED 2026-06-22 (Claude/Opus). FIX-1..5 all applied. Self-validated by static
               inspection: C1 (bins bounds) PASS, C2 (g real) PASS, C3 (covenant 3 real conds) PASS,
               C4 (real body_ms) PASS, C5 (Benettin tick-to-tick on ratio; cos_buf de-dual-used) PASS.
